	{
		"title": "Krimadikt Ice Cream",
		"slug": "krimadikt-ice-cream",
		"description": "Packaging design.",
		"image": "/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/thumb_LO2zBblXjD.webp",
		"content": "<p><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/01xmdVb90S2x_XtbMK8wqqH.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/02z4X42X0xU4_nTIVUWVihK.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><strong>Krimadikt</strong> is an ice cream brand that aims to transport consumers to a tropical paradise with every spoonful. Inspired by the lush landscapes and exotic flavors of tropical regions, Krimadikt offers a range of indulgent ice cream products that evoke feelings of relaxation, escape, and pure enjoyment.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/03qV6pR8ITZ6_pT69taadse.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/041DBmxeU8ho_bxcaZdivOq.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/051nYTFmw6TD_490gvjVOQd.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/06dHc6BGYCgv_y9jlysIXbB.webp\"></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 0px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 49.9733%;\"><col style=\"width: 49.9733%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/074PZiCDKRDt_w9Q9zRd5Km.webp\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/08Zc7cNeVHWq_4hqHVqmJGN.webp\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/09hL7r6FM83s_TCUsacW37p.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/krimadikt-ice-cream/10RmgrgDoZoF_MPkz5lDiSo.webp\"></p>",
