		"content": "<p><img src=\"/posts/adelaide-crows-2024-limited-merchandise/010ZsMZyp1wB_JCtwqwolCr.webp\"></p>\r\n<p>Concept for the Adelaide Crows Football Club Limited Collection - Season 2024. The products are characterised by a custom pattern inspired by the image of crow feathers.</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 0px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/adelaide-crows-2024-limited-merchandise/028SF5ZV5usq_KxH17UIzy1.webp\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/adelaide-crows-2024-limited-merchandise/034DtRQnNePJ_peCxvgtx42.webp\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 0px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/adelaide-crows-2024-limited-merchandise/04wpxrdeILYO_nfFaz2iZ0v.webp\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/adelaide-crows-2024-limited-merchandise/05kskCUYKRFP_MWRKu4FZiI.webp\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"/posts/adelaide-crows-2024-limited-merchandise/06aHC6RexA3v_LeFgPEpI2C.webp\"></td>\r\n<td><img src=\"/posts/adelaide-crows-2024-limited-merchandise/07sFNWO4WILC_E2We6P7BdM.webp\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
