		"content": "<p>A set of two posters designed to promote tourism in Vietnam, highlighting the cities of Hanoi and Saigon along with their renowned landmarks: the One Pillar Pagoda in Hanoi and the Ben Thanh Market in Saigon.</p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 0px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/hanoi-saigon-posters/hn9PjFrP79nu_YdlACY5PMe.webp\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"border-width: 0px;\"><img src=\"/posts/hanoi-saigon-posters/sgbSurnVCBcp_WuynvNIcNd.webp\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border-width: 0px; border-style: none;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50.0199%;\"><col style=\"width: 50.0199%;\"></colgroup></table>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/hanoi-saigon-posters/hn_sg_04lMxRttDn.webp\"></p>",
