	{
		"title": "Gia An 115 Hospital Wayfinding Icon System",
		"slug": "gia-an-115-hospital-wayfinding-icon-system",
		"description": "Wayfinding icon system design.",
		"image": "/posts/gia-an-115-hospital-wayfinding-icon-system/thumbnail_j4WKPj2wfa.webp",
		"content": "<p>A project aimed at developing a wayfinding icon system, rooted in the existing logo design. This endeavor comprises a suite of six primary function icons, along with three supplementary function icons, all of which are creatively derived from the original logo of Gia An 115 Hospital.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/gia-an-115-hospital-wayfinding-icon-system/01tlN7ze8MgQ_GDfjZKVwp3.webp\"></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Emergency Department - Cardiology Department - Pharmacy</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/gia-an-115-hospital-wayfinding-icon-system/02incaZePWI5_sJTT9aSNYD.webp\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Laboratory Department - Consulting Room - Patient Room</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/gia-an-115-hospital-wayfinding-icon-system/03F1W18hFdSf_XjNmudE9Uk.webp\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Laundry Unit - Parking Lot - Waste Disposal Area</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/gia-an-115-hospital-wayfinding-icon-system/04lzTUEodram_koT69PmpGB.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/gia-an-115-hospital-wayfinding-icon-system/05hmLWGy6bft_khdtlvBgDb.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/gia-an-115-hospital-wayfinding-icon-system/062wmNeKxjkF_MDz8jhfIy5.webp\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/posts/gia-an-115-hospital-wayfinding-icon-system/07JInFBQtbaq_T2AcEYY9Ss.webp\"></p>",
